{"3308220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galatico", "steam_appid": 3308220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.poster.avif?t=1777548082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.webm?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.mp4?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powerful mega-corporation, <strong>Galatico</strong>, controls the universe’s premier mode of transportation: portals. In this fast paced, first-person retro shooter set in the far future, you will battle your way through relentless Guards, advanced Sentries, formidable Generals, and fearsome Hunters to dismantle the corporation’s iron grip on the most advanced tech known: Portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.poster.avif?t=1777548082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.webm?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.mp4?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, high-octane battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Enemies</strong>: Confront a diverse array of foes, each with unique abilities and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Utilise portals to outmanoeuvre opponents and gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Action</strong>: Master your skills to survive in boomer shooter-inspired levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspirations</strong>: Drawn from legendary titles like <strong>Doom, Dusk, Zortch, Ultrakill</strong> and many other iconic first-person shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.poster.avif?t=1777548082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.webm?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/2ba96ca2a98d4590c3a89d6a4a77b06f.mp4?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The powerful mega-corporation, <strong>Galatico</strong>, controls the universe’s premier mode of transportation: portals. In this fast paced, first-person retro shooter set in the far future, you will battle your way through relentless Guards, advanced Sentries, formidable Generals, and fearsome Hunters to dismantle the corporation’s iron grip on the most advanced tech known: Portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.poster.avif?t=1777548082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.webm?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/extras/3b66df157ccf30b9c39f43c0f61428b7.mp4?t=1777548082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, high-octane battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Enemies</strong>: Confront a diverse array of foes, each with unique abilities and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Utilise portals to outmanoeuvre opponents and gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Action</strong>: Master your skills to survive in boomer shooter-inspired levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspirations</strong>: Drawn from legendary titles like <strong>Doom, Dusk, Zortch, Ultrakill</strong> and many other iconic first-person shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Blast your way to the top of GALATICO, a high-tempo movement shooter inspired by the best shooters of the 90s. Dismantle the gatekeepers of the universe's most powerful technology: Portals. Clock-in… it's time to trim the fat from GALATICO.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308220/f3e1a0a8b365b170d327ad2d634d7e5e845e8820/header